# RFC-0016 K8b (section 12 item 4, first clause): exact rows
# exercised by the axis suites (s0016_k8b_axes `axisFiles`), per axis.
# axis<TAB>exercised<TAB>exact rows. K1 judges it per leg. It only rises;
# measured on linux-c; a full run on that row holds the figure to its floor
# (above it fails until the floor is raised); other rows are held only at or
# above it. A changed exact-row count must be re-measured.
